      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I need to give a shout out to Alex for his commitment to customer service. With so many solar installers out there, I feel like I got lucky landing Sulex to handle our little 5kW PV system. He is incredibly thorough and made sure I was informed at every step of the way - from hardware selection, the rebate process, grid tie-in all the way thru to setting up our monitoring software. Pretty soon after locking Alex in for the install, I felt comfortable having him do our mains power and switchboard upgrades too - at a very reasonable cost. Our solar works were done as part of a whole house renovation and Alex was by far the most reliable tradie we had. Highly recommend.",
